   },
   "source": [
    "## 負載模型\n",
    "\n",
    "使用`transformers` 庫透過`AutoProcessor` 和`AutoModelForImageTextToText` 類別建立`processor` 和`model` 的實例，如下列程式碼範例所示："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "d4ebfb95",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "vNLDpsrxxW76"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json": {
       "model_id": "ebbd88f6ff4f4c29913db37e2b461389",
       "version_major": 2,
       "version_minor": 0
      },
      "text/plain": [
       "Loading weights:   0%|          | 0/2011 [00:00<?, ?it/s]"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "MODEL_ID = \"google/gemma-4-E2B-it\" # @param [\"google/gemma-4-E2B-it\",\"google/gemma-4-E4B-it\", \"google/gemma-4-31B-it\", \"google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "from transformers import AutoProcessor, AutoModelForMultimodalLM\n",
    "\n",
    "model = AutoModelForMultimodalLM.from_pretrained(MODEL_ID, dtype=\"auto\", device_map=\"auto\")\n",
    "processor = AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(MODEL_ID)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "attachments": {},
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bee140e4",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "wxecqctHQo57"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 音訊數據\n",
    "\n",
    "數位音訊資料可以有多種格式和解析度等級。 Gemma 可使用的實際音訊格式（例如 MP3 和 WAV 格式）由您選擇將聲音資料轉換為張量的 framework 決定。以下是準備使用 Gemma 處理的音訊資料的一些具體注意事項：\n",
    "-   **token 成本：** 對於 Gemma 4，每秒音訊為 25 tokens。 （對於 Gemma 3n，每秒音訊為 6.25 tokens）。\n",
    "-   **剪輯長度：** 音訊支援的最大長度為 30 秒。\n",
    "-   **音訊通道：** 音訊資料以單一音訊通道進行處理。\n",
    "    If you are using multi-channel audio, such as left and right channels,\n",
    "    consider reducing the data to a single channel by removing channels or\n",
    "    combining the sound data into a single channel.\n",
    "-   **技術編碼：**\n",
    "- **取樣率：** 16kHz，使用 32ms 幀。 - **位元深度：** 32 位元浮點格式，樣本在 [-1, 1] 範圍內標準化。\n",
    "如果您計劃處理的音訊資料與輸入明顯不同\n",
    "處理，特別是在通道、取樣率和位元深度方面，\n",
    "考慮重新採樣或修剪音訊資料以匹配數據\n",
    "模型處理的解析度。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "attachments": {},
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "47334533",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "1XY2zy4WYEfD"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 音訊編碼\n",
    "\n",
    "雖然高級庫（例如 Hugging Face `AutoProcessor`）通常會自動處理音訊預處理，但有時您可能需要實作自訂編碼。\n",
    "當使用您自己的程式碼實作對音訊資料進行編碼以便與 Gemma 一起使用時，您應該遵循建議的轉換過程。如果你正在工作\n",
    "以特定格式編碼的音訊文件，例如 MP3 或 WAV 編碼數據，\n",
    "您必須先使用library（例如`ffmpeg`）將它們解碼為樣本。曾經\n",
    "資料被解碼，將音訊轉換為單聲道、16 kHz float32\n",
    "波形在 [-1, 1] 範圍內。例如，如果您正在使用立體聲\n",
    "若要以 44.1 kHz 簽署 16 位元 PCM 整數 WAV 文件，請依照下列步驟操作：\n",
    "*   將音訊資料重新取樣至 16 kHz\n",
    "*   透過平均 2 個聲道將立體聲縮混為單聲道\n",
    "*   從 int16 轉換為 float32，並除以 32768.0 以縮放到範圍\n",
    "    [-1, 1]\n",
    "\n",
    "> 注意：將音訊重新取樣至 16 kHz 時，應使用傅立葉方法以獲得最佳結果，例如 `scipy.signal.resample` 或 `librosa.sample(res_type ='scipy')`。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "attachments": {},
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5efb4196",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "UVsjGP7D65Cn"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 語音轉文字\n",
    "\n",
    "Gemma 4 E2B 和 E4B 經過多語言語音辨識訓練，讓您可以將各種語言的音訊輸入轉錄為文字。以下程式碼範例示範如何prompt模型以使用Hugging Face Transformers從音訊檔案轉錄文字："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "210fe05f",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "twIe6-nYAnpy"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "<bos><|turn>user\n",
      "Transcribe the following speech segment in its original language. Follow these specific instructions for formatting the answer:\n",
      "* Only output the transcription, with no newlines.\n",
      "* When transcribing numbers, write the digits, i.e. write 1.7 and not one point seven, and write 3 instead of three.<|audio><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><|audio|><audio|><turn|>\n",
      "<|turn>model\n",
      "I woke up early today feeling really fresh the morning light was beautiful and I enjoyed a nice cup of coffee<turn|>\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "RESOURCE_URL_PREFIX = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google-gemma/cookbook/refs/heads/main/Demos/sample-data/\"\n",
    "\n",
    "messages = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "        \"content\": [\n",
    "            {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Transcribe the following speech segment in its original language. Follow these specific instructions for formatting the answer:\\n* Only output the transcription, with no newlines.\\n* When transcribing numbers, write the digits, i.e. write 1.7 and not one point seven, and write 3 instead of three.\"},\n",
    "            #{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Transcribe the following speech segment in English into English text. Follow these specific instructions for formatting the answer:\\n* Only output the transcription, with no newlines.\\n* When transcribing numbers, write the digits, i.e. write 1.7 and not one point seven, and write 3 instead of three.\"},\n",
    "            {\"type\": \"audio\", \"audio\": f\"{RESOURCE_URL_PREFIX}journal1.wav\"},\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "input_ids = processor.apply_chat_template(\n",
    "        messages,\n",
    "        add_generation_prompt=True,\n",
    "        tokenize=True, return_dict=True,\n",
    "        return_tensors=\"pt\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "input_ids = input_ids.to(model.device, dtype=model.dtype)\n",
    "\n",
    "outputs = model.generate(**input_ids, max_new_tokens=64)\n",
    "\n",
    "text = processor.batch_decode(\n",
    "    outputs,\n",
    "    skip_special_tokens=False,\n",
    "    clean_up_tokenization_spaces=False\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(text[0])"
   ]
  },
